\item within this language:\\

\item in other languages:\\

\end{enumerate}
\item[* relevant literature/documents:]
\item[\ \ remarks:]\mbox{}
\begin{enumerate}
\item problems:\\

\item modifications:
7/12/88: Condition on perfective aspect added to match conditions.\\

\end{enumerate}
\end{description}

