\item date: ../../..\ \ \ \ \ author:
\end{enumerate}
\item[* task:] to make open subordinate sentences with an -ingform. The name 
`anterelative' is retained, even though English uses `postrelatives' for this 
kind of modification.
\item[\ \ strategy:] (also: deviations from accepted proposals)
