\item[* relevant literature/documents:]
\item[\ \ remarks:]\mbox{}
\begin{enumerate}
\item problems:\\ 

\item modifications:
12/12/88: Added conditions on aspect and splitted up into two subrules.
Two ingforms are excluded. If the ingform should be equivalent to a finite 
sentence in the progressive tense, the auxiliary ver {\em be} is introduced in 
cases this is allowed (subrule 1).  Subrule 2 is for cases the auxiliary verb 
should not be introduced and for  relative sentences with {\em having....}.\\

\end{enumerate}
